    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Mourning Wood</strong> is a hand-drawn adult visual novel packed with comedy, mystery, and plenty of NSFW fun. You play as <strong>&quot;El Presidente&quot;</strong>, the wayward son of a powerful Caribbean dictator. After growning spoiled and unruly, you're shipped off to a remote American reform camp for troubled young adults which, to your surprise, is <i>entirely female</i>.<br>(It\u2019s a porn game. Don't think about it too much.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Camp Mourning Wood holds more than just hard labor and questionable reform strategies though. A strange magic stirs in the forest, and something dark is creeping in. Make friends, uncover mysteries, rebuild the crumbling reform camp and find a way to protect it from the coming darkness that is haunting the Mourning Woods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 fully hand-drawn</strong> erotic scenes by a team of talented artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of hours</strong> of quests, character arcs, and side stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of <strong>absurd comedy</strong>, <strong>emotional depth</strong>, and <strong>pornographic storytelling</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your relations and help rebuild the ruined camp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of sexy, troubled, and sometimes unhinged campmates \u2014 each with their own secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, magic, mystery... and plenty of mature content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the laughs, the lore, or the lewdness, Camp Mourning Wood welcomes you with open arms \u2014 and maybe open legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming to Early Access in November 2025.</strong></p>",
